GIVEN identifier IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE STRING
`the heading of the provision` MEANS
    CONSIDER filter (GIVEN entry YIELD entry's `identifier` EQUALS identifier) `the provisions of the Act`
    WHEN EMPTY THEN NOTHING
    WHEN first FOLLOWED BY rest THEN JUST (first's `heading as printed`)

GIVEN identifier IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the provision is in the index` MEANS
    elem identifier (map (GIVEN entry YIELD entry's `identifier`) `the provisions of the Act`)

GIVEN identifier IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE STRING
`the kind of the provision` MEANS
    CONSIDER filter (GIVEN entry YIELD entry's `identifier` EQUALS identifier) `the provisions of the Act`
    WHEN EMPTY THEN NOTHING
    WHEN first FOLLOWED BY rest THEN JUST (first's `kind of provision`)
